            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>This update fixes the bug where every update broke the fn key. macOS will ask you to re-grant Accessibility <b>one last time</b> after installing — the app's panel walks you through it — and from then on the permission should survive updates for good.</p>
                <p>Also new: Settings opens on a list of every keyboard shortcut, and the panel returns to its front page each time you open it.</p>
            ]]></description>
